/*
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**

# The scrapes tooling: generators and manifest are tracked, the dumps they
# produce are not. Every .txt in there regenerates from sources.toml.
# Each directory level has to be un-ignored explicitly because of the /* above.
!edu/
edu/*
!edu/scrapes/
edu/scrapes/*
!edu/scrapes/*.py
!edu/scrapes/sources.toml
!edu/scrapes/README.md
